      "natural_statement": "Adversarially audit, verify, or refute OpenAI Manuscript Family 008 (The Deligne–Drinfeld conjecture.; papers: The Deligne-Drinfeld conjecture; Lean status: Partially/Comparator formalized (lean/docs/008.md)): either (a) discover and certify an explicit mathematical flaw, sign/orientation error, counterexample to an intermediate lemma, or statement-fidelity/citation gap with a deterministic symbolic/computational certificate (`verify.py` + `exact_certificate.json`), or (b) independently verify, repair, or generalize the manuscript's core mathematical theorem with a standalone machine-checkable certificate certified by the independent Reviewer.",
