      },
      "natural_statement": "W_n=0 for n=0,1,2. Weight zero has no free-Lie monomials; the degree-one pentagon residual is -alpha*t_12-beta*t_34; the degree-two three-term residual on [x,y] is 3[x,y].",
      "formal_statement": "",
