        "content_hash": "dd428c1f2bed1cab89574d6bc38a111ef63a44a2d2c1d0d6e0a33bb4eae64940"
      },
      "natural_statement": "The integral ordinary free-Lie and braid lattices are torsion free, their reductions embed in associative words, and ordinary free-Lie dimensions agree over Q and F_2 in every fixed positive weighted degree.",
      "formal_statement": "",
      "external_assumptions": [],
      "retired_assumptions": [],
      "content_hash": "283c1adf31adff75b042c1879c10fedeebe9a244f290a0ddbe663c3a741d0d57"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "L_SPECIAL",
      "version": 1,
      "context": {
        "kind": "context",
        "subject_id": "CTX_UB",
        "content_hash": "dd428c1f2bed1cab89574d6bc38a111ef63a44a2d2c1d0d6e0a33bb4eae64940"
      },
      "natural_statement": "For psi in W_n with n>2, the staged special identity [a,psi(b,a)]+[c,psi(b,c)]=0 for c=-a-b, and the linearization partial_2 psi(a,-a)T=0, hold over Q before reduction.",
      "formal_statement": "",
      "external_assumptions": [],
      "retired_assumptions": [],
      "content_hash": "5cf296068dc5855ee73dfd35c889f711f7dd321621eed70baa331e981f953e7a"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "L_SATURATED_TRANSFER",
      "version": 1,
      "context": {
        "kind": "context",
        "subject_id": "CTX_UB",
        "content_hash": "dd428c1f2bed1cab89574d6bc38a111ef63a44a2d2c1d0d6e0a33bb4eae64940"
      },
      "natural_statement": "For each n, intersection of W_n with the ordinary integral Lie lattice has an injective reduction of dimension dim_Q W_n, satisfying the reduced defining equations and, for n>2, the reduced special equations; no arbitrary modular lifting is assumed.",
      "formal_statement": "",
      "external_assumptions": [],
      "retired_assumptions": [],
      "content_hash": "f42441be9e2997b22c7896d9bf1214d41b169e09daa69431d586e119c23e7118"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "L_ABC",
